ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTwYyGLSB9CLLkqCB_2LSWxVqbHubTTQpL5aWRDWPl3Mg&oe=6AF9E3BA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCover.png", "id": "548870900688455", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974672_548870904021788_6181817618579528152_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GQO7jaQK-zgQ7kNvwFEr2kZ&_nc_oc=AdpQI_ulIMceEmpBdikhNSZ583GIQzl_YUre_2nzukqvWTT_g-8PMPRz0xANwIkb94s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8W4pWTRxBHi4vyXVV1eUxue0jtqOyjYt7rCr1UcgkaQ&oe=6AF9CDF8"}, "display_name": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific opens the next chapter in aviation history. Become a World War II pilot and take part in the campaign against the Empire of Japan. The sequel to the hit Warplanes: WW1 Fighters, takes dogfight to a new level.\n\nRealistic graphics and intuitive controls enhance the gameplay experience. The new flight model will make you feel the power, speed and handling of the most popular American and Japanese aircraft. The technological leap between World War I and World War II made aviation the leading branch of the military and changed war forever...\n\nWW2 EXPERIENCE IN VR\n\u25cf Lead the US to victory over Japan in the single player campaign.\n\u25cf Play classic PvP multiplayer modes to face off against players from around the world.\n\u25cf Have fun with friends by your side playing co-op missions.\n\u25cf Take controls of 15 of the most iconic aircraft fighting over the Pacific.\n\u25cf Adjust the game to your preferences thanks to 3 difficulty levels.\n", "short_description": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific opens the next chapter in aviation history. Become a World War II pilot and take part in the campaign against the Empire of Japan. The sequel to the hit Warplanes: WW1 Fighters, takes dogfight to a new level.\n\n\u25cf Lead the US to victory over Japan in the single player campaign.\n\u25cf Play classic PvP multiplayer modes to face off against players from around the world.\n\u25cf Have fun with friends by your side playing co-op missions."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2360750237757499", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific abre el siguiente cap\u00edtulo en la historia de la aviaci\u00f3n. Convi\u00e9rtete en un piloto de la Segunda Guerra Mundial y forma parte de la campa\u00f1a contra el Imperio de Jap\u00f3n o sum\u00e9rgete en un intenso multijugador. La secuela del \u00e9xito Warplanes: WW1 Fighters, lleva el combate a\u00e9reo a un nuevo nivel.\n\nLo gr\u00e1ficos realistas y el control intuitivo mejoran la experiencia de jugabilidad. El nuevo modelo de vuelo te har\u00e1 sentir la potencia, velocidad y maniobrabilidad de la mayor\u00eda de las aeronaves populares japonesas y americanas. El salto tecnol\u00f3gico entre la Primera Guerra Mundial y la Segunda Guerra Mundial hizo de la aviaci\u00f3n la rama l\u00edder del ej\u00e9rcito y cambi\u00f3 la guerra para siempre...\n\nEXPERIENCIA DE LA IIGM EN RV\n\u25cf Asume el control de 10 de las aeronaves m\u00e1s ic\u00f3nicas es una pelea sobre el Pac\u00edfico.\n\u25cf Lleva a los EE. UU. a la victoria sobre Jap\u00f3n en la campa\u00f1a individual. \n\u25cf Juega los modos cl\u00e1sicos multijugador JvJ para enfrentarte a jugadores de todo el mundo. \n\u25cf Divi\u00e9rtete al lado de tus amigos mientras juegan misiones cooperativas. \n\u25cf Ajusta el juego a tus preferencias gracias a 3 niveles de dificultad.\n\n", "short_description": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific abre el siguiente cap\u00edtulo en la historia de la aviaci\u00f3n. Convi\u00e9rtete en un piloto de la Segunda Guerra Mundial y forma parte de la campa\u00f1a contra el Imperio de Jap\u00f3n o sum\u00e9rgete en un intenso multijugador. La secuela del \u00e9xito Warplanes: WW1 Fighters, lleva el combate a\u00e9reo a un nuevo nivel.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1886789215306826", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific apre il prossimo capitolo della storia dell'aviazione. Diventa un pilota della Seconda Guerra Mondiale e prendi parte alla campagna contro l'Impero del Giappone o tuffati in un intenso multiplayer. Il sequel del successo Warplanes: WW1 Fighters, porta il combattimento aereo a un nuovo livello.\n\nLa grafica realistica e i controlli intuitivi migliorano l'esperienza di gioco. Il nuovo modello di volo ti far\u00e0 sentire la potenza, la velocit\u00e0 e la maneggevolezza dei pi\u00f9 popolari velivoli americani e giapponesi. Il salto tecnologico tra la Prima e la Seconda Guerra Mondiale ha reso l'aviazione una componente fondamentale per qualsiasi esercito e ha cambiato per sempre la guerra...\n\nLA SECONDA GUERRA MONDIALE IN VR\n\u25cf Prendi il controllo di 10 degli aerei pi\u00f9 iconici che hanno combattuto sul Pacifico.\n\u25cf Guida gli Stati Uniti verso vittoria sul Giappone nella campagna per giocatore singolo.\n\u25cf Gioca alle classiche modalit\u00e0 multiplayer PvP per affrontare giocatori di tutto il mondo.\n\u25cf Divertiti con gli amici al tuo fianco giocando alle missioni co-op.\n\u25cf Adatta il gioco alle tue preferenze grazie a 3 livelli di difficolt\u00e0.\n", "short_description": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific apre il prossimo capitolo della storia dell'aviazione. Diventa un pilota della Seconda Guerra Mondiale e prendi parte alla campagna contro l'Impero del Giappone o tuffati in un intenso multiplayer. Il sequel del successo Warplanes: WW1 Fighters, porta il combattimento aereo a un nuovo livello.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1462545142006965", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific entame le nouveau chapitre de l\u2019histoire de l\u2019aviation. Devenez un pilote de la Seconde Guerre mondiale et participez \u00e0 la campagne contre l\u2019Empire du Japon ou plongez dans d\u2019intenses affrontements multijoueur. La suite du jeu \u00e0 succ\u00e8s Warplanes: WW1 Fighters, fait passer les duels a\u00e9riens \u00e0 la vitesse sup\u00e9rieure.\n\nDes graphismes r\u00e9alistes et des commandes intuitives am\u00e9liorent l\u2019exp\u00e9rience de jeu. Le nouveau mod\u00e8le de pilotage vous permettra de ressentir la puissance, la vitesse et le maniement des avions de chasse am\u00e9ricains et japonais les plus populaires. Le bond technologique entre la Premi\u00e8re Guerre mondiale et la Seconde Guerre mondiale a fait de l\u2019aviation la branche majeure des arm\u00e9es et chang\u00e9 la guerre \u00e0 tout jamais\u2026\n\nVIVEZ L\u2019EXP\u00c9RIENCE DE LA SECONDE GUERRE MONDIALE EN VR\n\u25cf Pilotez 10 des avions de chasse les plus embl\u00e9matiques au-dessus du Pacifique.\n\u25cf Menez les \u00c9tats-Unis \u00e0 la victoire face au Japon lors de la campagne solo.\n\u25cf Jouez \u00e0 des modes multijoueur JcJ classique dans lesquels vous affrontez des joueurs du monde entier.\n\u25cf Amusez-vous avec vos amis en menant ensemble des missions en co-op.\n\u25cf Ajustez le jeu selon vos pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences gr\u00e2ce aux 3 modes de difficult\u00e9.\n", "short_description": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific entame le nouveau chapitre de l\u2019histoire de l\u2019aviation. Devenez un pilote de la Seconde Guerre mondiale et participez \u00e0 la campagne contre l\u2019Empire du Japon ou plongez dans d\u2019intenses affrontements multijoueur. La suite du jeu \u00e0 succ\u00e8s Warplanes: WW1 Fighters, fait passer les duels a\u00e9riens \u00e0 la vitesse sup\u00e9rieure.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "932327939553026", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Warplanes: Battles over Pacific", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u300a\u6218\u673a\uff1a\u6fc0\u6218\u592a\u5e73\u6d0b\u300b\u7ffb\u5f00\u4e86\u822a\u7a7a\u53f2\u7684\u4e0b\u4e00\u7bc7\u7ae0\u3002\u5316\u8eab\u4e8c\u6218\u98de\u884c\u5458\uff0c\u5bf9\u6297\u65e5\u672c\u5e1d\u56fd\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u52a0\u5165\u6fc0\u70c8\u7684\u591a\u4eba\u6e38\u620f\u3002\u70ed\u95e8\u6e38\u620f\u300a\u6218\u673a\uff1a\u4e00\u6218\u6218\u6597\u673a\u300b\u7684\u7eed\u4f5c\u4e3a\u73a9\u5bb6\u5448\u73b0\u4e86\u66f4\u9ad8\u6c34\u51c6\u7684\u8fd1\u8ddd\u79bb\u7a7a\u6218\u3002\n\n\u903c\u771f\u7684\u753b\u9762\u548c\u7b80\u4fbf\u7684\u64cd\u4f5c\u5e26\u6765\u4f18\u8d28\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u4f53\u9a8c\u3002\u5168\u65b0\u7684\u98de\u884c\u6a21\u578b\u8ba9\u73a9\u5bb6\u80fd\u591f\u5207\u8eab\u4f53\u4f1a\u6700\u4e3a\u8457\u540d\u7684\u7f8e\u56fd\u4e0e\u65e5\u672c\u98de\u673a\u7684\u5a01\u529b\u3001\u901f\u5ea6\u548c\u9a7e\u9a76\u611f\u3002\u4e24\u6b21\u4e16\u754c\u5927\u6218\u4e4b\u95f4\u7684\u6280\u672f\u98de\u8dc3\u4f7f\u5f97\u822a\u7a7a\u5175\u6210\u4e3a\u4e86\u519b\u961f\u7684\u5173\u952e\uff0c\u6c38\u8fdc\u6539\u53d8\u4e86\u6218\u4e89\u7684\u9762\u8c8c\u2026\u2026\n\n\u901a\u8fc7VR\u4f53\u9a8c\u4e8c\u6218\n\u25cf \u9a7e\u9a7610\u79cd\u6700\u5178\u578b\u7684\u98de\u673a\uff0c\u6fc0\u6218\u592a\u5e73\u6d0b\u3002\n\u25cf \u5728\u5355\u4eba\u6218\u5f79\u4e2d\u5e26\u9886\u7f8e\u56fd\u6218\u80dc\u65e5\u672c\u3002\n\u25cf \u5728\u7ecf\u5178\u7684PvP\u591a\u4eba\u6a21\u5f0f\u4e2d\u5bf9\u6297\u4e16\u754c\u5404\u5730\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\u3002\n\u25cf \u548c\u597d\u53cb\u4e00\u540c\u7545\u73a9\u5408\u4f5c\u4efb\u52a1\u3002\n\u25cf \u6839\u636e\u4e2a\u4eba\u559c\u597d\uff0c\u57283\u4e2a\u96be\u5ea6\u7b49\u7ea7\u4e2d\u81ea\u7531\u9009\u62e9\u3002\n", "short_description": "\u300a\u6218\u673a\uff1a\u6fc0\u6218\u